{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 35, :comments ["<b>Who are gathered against me.</b> Who said to stone with stones the servants of HaShem, because they said, \"the glory of HaShem.\"" "<b>In this wilderness.</b> It is orphaned. The end of each one — there it sets the end of each one." "<b>And there they shall die.</b> All of them, near the end."], :book :numbers, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 14, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:17:42.274653363Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}